<title>CHINA: Shanghai Dazhong fulfills 1996 target.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Dazhong fulfills 1996 target.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai Dazhong Taxi Co Ltd has fulfilled its 1996 post-tax profit target of 110 million yuan according to Chinese accounting standards, a company spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The company had a net profit of 100.82 million yuan in 1995.</p>
<p>The spookesman said Dazhong expects post-tax profit to increase in the range of 10 to 15 percent in 1997 against 1996.</p>
<p>He declined to give further details.</p>
</text>
